    {
      "id": "u_0a6af9900c5e1b352df3aae9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium is designed to store a wide variety of data, including sensitive information such as personal journals, credentials, or confidential documents. To safeguard this type of content, Trilium offers the option to protect notes, which involves the following measures:",
      "sourceHash": "0a6af9900c5e1b352df3aae937a9ff865c699ce3f6231f7a9ffa55443a1853af",
      "context": "Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "4bbdb8e76f77167410e120ddcb8b51de00ea5721adc3ff7033b8db4f6a704835",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_69f0de115f7d691258db44c1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Encryption:__TRILIUM_PH_1__ Protected notes are encrypted using a key derived from your password. This ensures that without the correct password, protected notes remain indecipherable. Even if someone gains access to your Trilium __TRILIUM_PH_2__database__TRILIUM_PH_3__, they won't be able to read your encrypted notes.",
      "sourceHash": "69f0de115f7d691258db44c186338711bf6f347f4cabb91dd36cfceb6d08dbc3",
      "context": "Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "4bbdb8e76f77167410e120ddcb8b51de00ea5721adc3ff7033b8db4f6a704835",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_038b042761ecfaca35ec300e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Time-limited access:__TRILIUM_PH_1__ To access protected notes, you must first enter your password, which decrypts the note for reading and writing. However, after a specified period of inactivity (10 minutes by default), the note is unloaded from memory, requiring you to re-enter your password to access it again.",
      "sourceHash": "038b042761ecfaca35ec300e339d90f2e189e202eb13d3054a2aacc1f04cd045",
      "context": "Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "4bbdb8e76f77167410e120ddcb8b51de00ea5721adc3ff7033b8db4f6a704835",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9c2e19af3385e40d3dc923f6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The session timeout is extended automatically while you're interacting with the protected note, so if you're actively editing, the session remains open. However, if you switch to an unprotected note, the session timer starts, and the session expires after 10 minutes of inactivity unless you return to the protected notes.",
      "sourceHash": "9c2e19af3385e40d3dc923f67f9366d4099f91a7661a5aab4aadf0dc2b6554ca",
      "context": "Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "4bbdb8e76f77167410e120ddcb8b51de00ea5721adc3ff7033b8db4f6a704835",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_00bbee9b022e9e3c139186f3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Protection scope:__TRILIUM_PH_1__ Protected notes ensure the confidentiality of their content and partially their integrity. While unauthorized users cannot read or edit protected notes, they can still delete or move them outside of the protected session.",
      "sourceHash": "00bbee9b022e9e3c139186f30812daffba4ca5f031cd8d2b81021d98be25ba72",
      "context": "Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "4bbdb8e76f77167410e120ddcb8b51de00ea5721adc3ff7033b8db4f6a704835",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5dd3ac9196e5f198b2bea758_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Using Protected Notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "5dd3ac9196e5f198b2bea75897ff80f4ba336acfa3af4a8a791c36358211c996",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Using Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "006b769c0913bb847efc2a042a8ce5002de9681db78a5ed8bef6e950db3b9c37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fe3f4f7952867982d8b561cb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, notes are unprotected. To protect a note, simply click on the shield icon next to the note's title, as shown here:",
      "sourceHash": "fe3f4f7952867982d8b561cb0660b9154427efe3f73f1b56c383612b2e83b3ee",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Using Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "006b769c0913bb847efc2a042a8ce5002de9681db78a5ed8bef6e950db3b9c37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
