    {
      "id": "u_65e2a094893044f266084081_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Encryption Details__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "65e2a094893044f266084081de2b389cc6beb3938412e9190c3a32012ce0ba9c",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f88f8164fdbfe709b5034bb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The following steps outline how encryption and decryption work in Trilium:",
      "sourceHash": "4f88f8164fdbfe709b5034bbc7935bd5f925a093254df02f88b07708c61280e8",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d85149d786df2b97b5c9e3a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The user enters a password.",
      "sourceHash": "2d85149d786df2b97b5c9e3acf26485b4faf96b680baa5f748dd657442288217",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_556d314df628e3a1a4dc3b57_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The password is passed through the __TRILIUM_PH_0__scrypt__TRILIUM_PH_1__ algorithm along with a \"password verification\" __TRILIUM_PH_2__salt__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to confirm that the password is correct.",
      "sourceHash": "556d314df628e3a1a4dc3b573bd470be9fbdb0776847593488a8b97262f393d3",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a31894b97dca5f600a5addea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The password is then processed again through scrypt with an \"encryption\" salt, which generates a hash.",
      "sourceHash": "a31894b97dca5f600a5addea6edcadafeb086ebfbe47cfb9713b719495abbb9d",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c003c31b649117c5994bbee7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Scrypt is used for __TRILIUM_PH_0__key stretching__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to make the password harder to guess.",
      "sourceHash": "c003c31b649117c5994bbee731245d52dc4a3fdce918adee473cd40c11eddafa",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_11ba027074366cb837b17b8c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The generated hash is used to decrypt the actual __TRILIUM_PH_0__data encryption key__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "11ba027074366cb837b17b8c869012723aabedee8cce1d562c125677a26f04b0",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_94c9ddc55ccae5c09aa53d82_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The data encryption key is encrypted using __TRILIUM_PH_0__AES-128__TRILIUM_PH_1__ with a random __TRILIUM_PH_2__IV__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "94c9ddc55ccae5c09aa53d82160889279368b48ab832dfc36c3043ccf39af041",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3be84bcdf20db81e572f00c2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The data encryption key is randomly generated during the __TRILIUM_PH_0__database__TRILIUM_PH_1__ initialization and remains constant throughout the document’s lifetime. When the password is changed, only this key is re-encrypted.",
      "sourceHash": "3be84bcdf20db81e572f00c223c1344780fe27fc5141ea9ec85ce748d4ccf8ca",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_20ab598e224d4ff0dc9b0e5a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The data encryption key is then used to decrypt the actual content of the note, including its title and body.",
      "sourceHash": "20ab598e224d4ff0dc9b0e5a7bc42f605a139be85ae6df3fdcb2f22625aabb4b",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b2bc6c3c760956a15967a182_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The encryption algorithm used is AES-128 with __TRILIUM_PH_0__CBC mode__TRILIUM_PH_1__, where a unique IV is generated for each encryption operation and stored with the cipher text.",
      "sourceHash": "b2bc6c3c760956a15967a182a5adf14244ad2cd113f0e6bf4cfffee3854477d9",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Encryption Details",
      "contextHash": "1e81386b5296d18ff106698772c0e2bf5a6643404f93b4c2a1fa8325873a925f",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_66f86a35c4ca4205e13cef6d_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Sharing Protected Notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "66f86a35c4ca4205e13cef6daf8bfdbe15f48cbc8baff323026bec26308fbd96",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Sharing Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "9e82d879e34f64426cefaa8832a41b833116c2975c3caa64176054eae3594af3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_030f8e687146bd50023f071a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Protected notes cannot be shared in the same way as regular notes. Their encryption ensures that only authorized users with the correct password can access them.",
      "sourceHash": "030f8e687146bd50023f071a08c37da78bb726ddf290561a96e3550d21ab3d43",
      "context": "Protected Notes > Sharing Protected Notes",
      "contextHash": "9e82d879e34f64426cefaa8832a41b833116c2975c3caa64176054eae3594af3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
